# Git & Workflow

## Branching Strategy
- `feat/feature-name`: New features.
- `fix/bug-name`: Bug fixes.
- `refactor/component-name`: Code improvements without functional changes.

## Commit Messages (Conventional Commits)
- Format: `<type>(<scope>): <description>`
- Types: `feat`, `fix`, `docs`, `style`, `refactor`, `perf`, `test`, `chore`.
- Example: `feat(ui): add primary button to login page`

## Summary Requirement
- After significant changes, provide a brief summary of what was done to be used in a Pull Request description.